1
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,960
孩子们 吃早餐了 卢克 吃点水果吧
Kids, breakfast! Luke, why don't you have some fruit?

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:04,800
不用了 谢谢
Nah, I'm good.

3
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:08,760
行行行 我吃行了吧
Fine. I'll have some.

4
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,320
菲尔 开慢一点
Phil! Slow down!

5
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:11,860
不好意思 克莱尔
I'm sorry, Claire.

6
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,320
跟在家里不同 这里我是船长我说了算
Unlike at home, I'm the captain here.

7
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:19,900
我靠 菲尔 别闹了
Damn it, Phil, knock it off!

8
00:00:20,201 --> 00:00:21,229
收到
Copy that.

9
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,380
我挺喜欢这个的
You know, I like having these.

10
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,740
咱们应该买几台放家里用
We should get some for the house.

11
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:26,866
不行 你别想每天用讲对机
No, you're not going to ask me "What time is lunch?"

12
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,360
问我"几点吃午饭"
every day through a talkie-walkie.

13
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:32,099
小卡 我们得谈谈这个
Cam, we need to talk about this.

14
00:00:32,099 --> 00:00:33,934
我们家也有这种灯
We -- We have these lamps at home.

15
00:00:33,934 --> 00:00:35,260
我们竟然用的船灯
Okay, we have boat lamps.

16
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:36,760
对啊 感觉好受人肯定
I know. It's so validating.

17
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:39,040
就像那次我们在狗粮广告里
It's like that time we saw our can opener

18
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:40,660
看到咱家的开罐器一样
in that dog-food commercial.

19
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:42,540
我们租了一辆船屋
We rented a houseboat.

20
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:44,300
我爸让我们来游湖
My dad wanted us to take a big lake trip

21
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:46,680
好能观赏到99年来首次的日全食
so we could see the first total eclipse in 99 years.

22
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:47,680
从小在农场长大
You know, growing up on a farm,

23
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:49,598
我一直幻想在湖上生活
I always fantasized about lake life.

24
00:00:49,598 --> 00:00:51,400
对啊 谁都可以到湖里玩
Yeah. You know, anyone can go to the lake.

25
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:53,200
只有精英名流才能在湖面上睡觉
Only the elite can sleep on it.

26
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:55,040
以前小的时候 每年夏天
My parents used to take Claire and me

27
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:56,360
爸妈都会带我和克莱尔到湖上玩
every summer when we were kids.

28
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:58,920
我做梦都没想到我会嫁入一个湖上家族
Oh, I just never dreamed I would marry into a lake family.

29
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,620
我们家也用这个枕头
We have this pillow, too.

30
00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:03,380
我开始质疑我们的品味了
I'm beginning to question our taste.

31
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:06,070
别傻了 我们品味可好了
Oh, don't be ridiculous. We have great taste.

32
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,460
你这是什么鬼
What's all this, then?

33
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:10,560
医生说了 我服用抗生素期间
The doctor said absolutely no sun

34
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:11,700
绝对不能晒太阳
while I'm on these antibiotics.

35
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:12,920
晒到会怎样
And what would happen?

36
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,399
因为如果不会危及生命
Because if it's anything short of death,

37
00:01:14,399 --> 00:01:16,600
我觉得你都应该赌一把
I-I think you should risk it.

38
00:01:29,940 --> 00:01:32,260
-早上好 -早安 有人饿了吗
- Morning. - Good Morning! Who's hungry?

39
00:01:32,620 --> 00:01:33,460
曼尼 你的鸡蛋要什么吃法
Manny, how do you take your eggs?

40
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:34,661
吃上帝创造出来的原味
Like God made 'em.

41
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:39,420
曼尼 你在干嘛
Manny, what are you doing?

42
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:40,840
这不是曼尼
This isn't Manny.

43
00:01:40,980 --> 00:01:41,700
是曼尼尔
It's Manuel.

44
00:01:42,100 --> 00:01:44,000
他在试图为上大学打造新人设
He's trying to reinvent himself for college.

45
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,020
他想变成强壮安静的类型
He's going for a strong, silent type.

46
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:47,940
别试图定义我
Hey, don't try to define me, man.

47
00:01:48,605 --> 00:01:50,471
"曼尼尔"只能撑个五分钟
"Manuel"'s gonna last five minutes.

48
00:01:51,340 --> 00:01:52,939
人就是这样 我也没办法
It is what it is, man.

49
00:01:52,939 --> 00:01:54,253
好了 大家听好了
All right, everybody, listen up.

50
00:01:54,292 --> 00:01:56,686
-日蚀发生的确切时间是... -我们知道
- The eclipse is happening at exactly -- - We know, we know, we know.

51
00:01:56,686 --> 00:01:58,120
-我们知道发生的确切时间 爸爸 -对
- We know exactly when it's happening, Dad. - Yeah.

52
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:58,660
你说过了
You told us.

53
00:01:58,700 --> 00:02:00,082
那到时一定要回来这里
Then just make sure you get back here

54
00:02:00,082 --> 00:02:01,620
-我们才能一起观看 -没问题
- so we can watch it together. - No problem.

55
00:02:01,620 --> 00:02:04,040
爸爸 你认识"只是衣柜"的休·邓肯吗
Hey, Dad, you know Hugh Duncan from Just Closets?

56
00:02:04,220 --> 00:02:05,500
那个管衣柜叫"衣橱"的
That pretentious half-Brit

57
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:07,260
做作的半英国佬吗
that refers to closets as "wardrobes"?

58
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:08,060
他去世了
He died.

59
00:02:08,220 --> 00:02:09,920
我勒个去 我一直挺喜欢他的
Son of a gun. I always liked him.

60
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,300
发生这种事
Yeah, something like that happens

61
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:13,200
会让你意识到生命有多宝贵
makes you realize how precious life is, huh?

62
00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:14,820
早上好 各位家人
Morning, fam!

63
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:17,020
谁快来杀了我吧
Somebody kill me.

64
00:02:17,380 --> 00:02:18,820
本和我已经在一起几个月了
Ben and I have been dating a few months now,

65
00:02:18,820 --> 00:02:20,200
一切进展得很顺利
and things have been going so well,

66
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,920
于是我决定邀请他参加我们的家庭旅行
I decided to invite him on our family vacation.

67
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:23,520
我们知道需要...
We knew it would take some --

68
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,980
听你说话再久我都不会腻
I could listen to you talk forever.

69
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:27,800
我们知道说服他们需要费一番功夫
We knew it would take some convincing.

70
00:02:28,260 --> 00:02:30,640
我每天都要在办公室看到本那张蠢脸
It's bad enough that I have to see Ben's stupid face

71
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:31,580
已经很糟心了
at the office every day.

72
00:02:31,660 --> 00:02:32,800
你竟然还想带他参加我们的旅行
You want to bring him on our trip?

73
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:34,040
就因为他让你心烦
Just because he bugs you

74
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,340
不代表这就会毁了你的假期
doesn't mean this will ruin your vacation.

75
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:37,900
他就是我需要度假的罪魁祸首之一
He's a huge reason why I need a vacation!

76
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,280
我觉得你们说的都有道理
I mean, I can see both sides.

77
00:02:43,781 --> 00:02:46,303
有谁知道这些煎饼是不是无麸质的
Ohhh. Does anyone know if these pancakes are gluten-free?

78
00:02:46,303 --> 00:02:47,960
-我受不了了 -什么 怎么了
- I can't! - Why? What's wrong?

79
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:50,740
我受不了再听你聊麸质
I can't listen to you talk about gluten anymore!

80
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:53,120
或者牙齿保持器和气传过敏原
Or mouth guards or airborne allergens

81
00:02:53,140 --> 00:02:55,480
或任何你其他的怪毛病了
or any of your other weird afflictions!

82
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:58,000
-有谁看到我的大帽子了吗 -没有
- Has anyone seen my big hat? - No.

83
00:02:58,100 --> 00:02:59,680
其实呢 一起旅行就是个大错误
You know what? Traveling together was a big mistake.

84
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:01,240
我们就 各玩各的吧
Let's just... do our own thing.

85
00:03:03,232 --> 00:03:03,892
好吧
A-all right.

86
00:03:05,380 --> 00:03:07,439
你们今天有什么安排
What are you guys up to today?

87
00:03:07,439 --> 00:03:09,005
-划水 -船上的事
- Water skiing. - Boat stuff.

88
00:03:09,005 --> 00:03:10,473
不是吧
Ay, no.

89
00:03:10,660 --> 00:03:11,780
这是什么东西
What am I looking at?

90
00:03:11,780 --> 00:03:14,700
放轻松 你们都表现得像是没见过长袍一样
Okay, relax. You all act like you've never seen a caftan before.

91
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:17,520
我今天需要能透气的全包式服装
I just needed full breathable coverage today.

92
00:03:17,580 --> 00:03:19,700
还能看起来这么好看 简直赚到
The fact that it looks so great is just a bonus.

93
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:22,419
-这是什么 -卡通《泡泡孔雀鱼》
- What's that? - "Groovy Guppies."

94
00:03:22,419 --> 00:03:24,480
我要连看上一季
I'm gonna binge-watch the last season.

95
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:25,600
我都没听过这节目
I never heard of it.

96
00:03:25,660 --> 00:03:27,760
翘掉你妈要带你去做的活动
Get out of whatever your mommy's got you doing.

97
00:03:27,980 --> 00:03:29,960
你的人生即将改变
Your life is about to change.

98
00:03:30,260 --> 00:03:32,500
我要下船到那家小商店买墨镜
I'm going down to the little store to buy some sunglasses.

99
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:33,860
我想买好玩的款式
I'm thinking something fun.

100
00:03:33,980 --> 00:03:35,820
好吧 别买太花哨艳俗的
All right. Well, don't get anything too garish.

101
00:03:38,620 --> 00:03:40,920
尤物 岛上有派对
Hey, sexy! Party on the island!

102
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:41,920
来玩吧
Come by!

103
00:03:42,712 --> 00:03:43,705
-赞 -正点
- Yum! - Yum!

104
00:03:44,403 --> 00:03:45,708
-你在干什么 -刚才那是什么
- What are you doing? - What was that?

105
00:03:45,708 --> 00:03:46,971
-那是个男生 -那是个女生
- That was a boy! - That was a girl!

106
00:03:46,971 --> 00:03:48,380
-你在说什么 -你在说什么
- What are you talking about?! - What are you talking about?!

107
00:03:48,380 --> 00:03:49,580
不管刚才那是什么
Whatever that was,

108
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:52,160
我们都要在本找到我之前去他或她的派对
we're going to his/her party before Ben finds me.

109
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:54,440
邓菲队 五人组 你们准备好出发了吗
Team Dunphy, D to the five. You guys ready to go?

110
00:03:54,500 --> 00:03:55,600
你们想做什么
Yeah, what do you feel like doing?

111
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:56,640
我们刚才在想也许可以去远足
We were thinking maybe a hike?

112
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:58,200
看看植物 动物 还有...
A little flora, fauna, and --

113
00:03:58,200 --> 00:03:59,380
别了吧 我们要去参加派对
Forget it. We're going to a party.

114
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,759
但你们如果想找些好玩活动
But if you're looking for something fun,

115
00:04:00,759 --> 00:04:02,140
租赁处那人给了我们个宣传册
the rental guy gave us this pamphlet.

116
00:04:02,140 --> 00:04:03,980
谢了 我们已经有一个了 不过...
Thanks. We already got one, but --

117
00:04:03,980 --> 00:04:05,140
你们的和我们的不一样
Oh. Yours is different.

118
00:04:06,100 --> 00:04:06,900
帆伞 水上滑板
Parasailing, wakeboarding...

119
00:04:07,220 --> 00:04:08,080
水上喷气背包
jetpacking?

120
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:10,440
我们的写着日出椅上瑜伽
Ours has sunrise chair yoga,

121
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,580
湖岸上画水彩
watercolors at water's edge,

122
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:14,920
还有个叫观云的活动
and something called... cloud study?

123
00:04:15,060 --> 00:04:16,760
他们给外公的也是那个版本
Yeah, they gave that one to Grandpa, too.

124
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:17,780
他给我们的是老年人的版本吗
We got the old people one?

125
00:04:17,880 --> 00:04:19,680
不 他们为什么那么做
No! Why would they do that?

126
00:04:19,940 --> 00:04:23,220
貌似您二老今天有很多蓬松的云朵可看
Looks like you guys got some fluffy ones out today.

127
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:25,480
那朵云看起来像只小兔子
That one looks like a bunny.

128
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:26,560
真的
Oh, yeah.

129
00:04:29,807 --> 00:04:31,666
感觉我们就身在法国圣特罗佩一样
Ah. It feels like we're in St. Tropez.

130
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,200
我不喜欢湖
I don't trust lakes.

131
00:04:33,780 --> 00:04:37,340
在我老家 这种湖专门用来抛毒弃尸
Where I come from, this is where we dump drugs and dead bodies.

132
00:04:37,340 --> 00:04:38,136
你猜怎么着
You know what?

133
00:04:38,136 --> 00:04:40,960
让我带你来一趟小舟观光
I am gonna give you a little boat tour

134
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:43,460
向你展示这片湖所有的美好之处
and show you this lake in all of its glory,

135
00:04:43,460 --> 00:04:45,340
但你得抱着开放的心态
but you need to keep an open mind.

136
00:04:45,460 --> 00:04:46,500
好吧
Okay, fine.

137
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:49,380
让我们环游这片液体墓地吧
Let's ride around the liquid graveyard.

138
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:55,400
妈妈 乘小船让我肚肚疼
Mama, riding on small boats makes my tummy hurt.

139
00:04:55,700 --> 00:04:56,919
我能和莉莉留在这吗
Can I stay with Lily?

140
00:04:56,919 --> 00:04:58,054
好的 宝贝
Si, papi.

141
00:05:04,660 --> 00:05:06,980
那是斯科蒂 一个在这湖边长大的孩子
It was Scotty -- this local lake kid

142
00:05:06,980 --> 00:05:08,680
我13岁度假时与他结识
I met on vacation when I was 13.

143
00:05:08,900 --> 00:05:12,300
我当时疯狂迷上他了 所以在假期最后一天
I had a huge crush on him, so on the last day,

144
00:05:12,420 --> 00:05:15,340
我决定冒险一搏 吻了他
I decided to take a chance and I kissed him.

145
00:05:15,860 --> 00:05:17,620
那是我第一次亲吻男生
It was my first time ever kissing a boy,

146
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:18,820
所以当他向后躲开
so when he pulled away

147
00:05:18,820 --> 00:05:20,960
并告诉我他"不感兴趣"时
and said that he wasn't "into this,"

148
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,480
我特别羞愧
I was humiliated.

149
00:05:22,620 --> 00:05:25,280
显然我误读了一些信号 他是直男
I mean, I'd obviously misread signals. He was straight.

150
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:28,020
那之后的五年我都没对任何男生发过攻势
It was five years before I ever made a move on a guy again.

151
00:05:28,020 --> 00:05:29,920
即便五年后 我也不敢
And even then, I wouldn't dare

152
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:33,100
除非对方弯到有如花蝴蝶一般
unless he was basically floating across the room.

153
00:05:33,100 --> 00:05:35,100
这就是为什么我现在的老公是...
Which is why I ended up with --

154
00:05:35,100 --> 00:05:35,980
你懂的
Well, you know.

155
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:40,780
找到你要的东西了吗 兄弟
Finding everything okay, buddy?

156
00:05:40,940 --> 00:05:41,297
是的
Yeah.

157
00:05:41,297 --> 00:05:43,264
第一次来 有点...
Just, uh, first time here, so, uh...

158
00:05:43,740 --> 00:05:45,060
你看起来挺面熟的 我认识你吗
You look familiar. Do I know you?

159
00:05:45,060 --> 00:05:46,219
不 不不不
No! Nah, nah, nah.

160
00:05:46,219 --> 00:05:49,348
我只是来买点湖边必备品
Just picking up a few, uh, lake essentials.

161
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:50,940
好了
Okay.

162
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,639
你要抢我钱吗
Are you robbing me?

163
00:05:53,639 --> 00:05:55,053
天啊 不
God, no. No, um...

164
00:05:55,617 --> 00:05:57,614
这样吧 都拿去吧
You know what? Good.

165
00:05:59,740 --> 00:06:02,480
我读了一些脸书上写给休·邓肯的悼词
I started reading the tributes to Hugh Duncan on Facebook.

166
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:03,900
写悼词的人特别多
There were a ton of them.

167
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:06,540
人们不停地说他生前是个多好的人
People going on and on about what a great guy he was.

168
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,880
"休爷爷有次给了我一个老式听诊器
"Grandpa Hugh once gave me a vintage stethoscope,

169
00:06:09,300 --> 00:06:12,120
那激励我成为了一名儿科肿瘤学家"
which inspired me to become a pediatric oncologist."

170
00:06:13,180 --> 00:06:15,620
这让我很好奇我死后别人会怎么说我
Made me wonder what people will say about me when I'm gone.

171
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:18,980
亲爱的 我想把我的天文望远镜给你
Honey, I want you to have my telescope.

172
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:21,920
希望它能激励你爱上科学
May it inspire you to love science.

173
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:23,580
我已经爱科学了
I already love science.

174
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,640
我觉得这是你重大的人生转折点
This feels like a real turning point.

175
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:27,599
你有天会想把这段佳话告诉别人
You know, it's a story you'll want to tell people.

176
00:06:27,599 --> 00:06:29,892
"他总教导我要有摘星之志"
"He always told me to reach for the stars."

177
00:06:30,580 --> 00:06:31,020
谢谢您
Thanks?

178
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:33,275
艾丽克斯 你在哪
Alex! Where are you?

179
00:06:33,275 --> 00:06:35,100
是本 告诉他你今天都没见过我
Ohh! It's Ben. Tell him you haven't seen me.

180
00:06:35,100 --> 00:06:36,420
我不想和他说话
I don't want to talk to him.

181
00:06:37,620 --> 00:06:38,060
艾丽克斯
Alex?

182
00:06:39,460 --> 00:06:41,000
我们不过出去几个小时
We'll only be gone for a couple hours.

183
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:42,320
乔和莉莉不会有事的
Joe and Lily will be fine.

184
00:06:42,660 --> 00:06:43,557
等等 你瞧
Oh, wait. Look.

185
00:06:43,557 --> 00:06:45,180
是那个人很好的湖上管家
There's that nice lake butler

186
00:06:45,180 --> 00:06:46,949
他之前帮我拿过行李
that helped me earlier with my bags.

187
00:06:46,949 --> 00:06:48,820
先生 先生
Senor. Senor.

188
00:06:48,820 --> 00:06:51,260
你能帮我们看几个小时孩子吗
Could you take care of our kids for a couple of hours?

189
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:54,200
无论你在湖上能挣多少我都付你双倍
I will pay you double what you make working for the lake.

190
00:06:54,200 --> 00:06:54,860
不是吧
Seriously?

191
00:06:55,580 --> 00:06:56,200
我们认识的
You know me.

192
00:06:56,300 --> 00:06:57,780
我们一起乘车去的机场
We rode to the airport together.

193
00:06:57,880 --> 00:06:59,017
你能不能帮我们看孩子吧
Can you watch our kids or not?

194
00:06:59,017 --> 00:07:00,464
其实我现在有点...
Actually, I'm kind of, uh --

195
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:01,780
艾丽克斯
Alex?

196
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:08,180
他们对什么食物过敏吗
Any food allergies I should know about?

197
00:07:09,580 --> 00:07:11,860
这挺有趣的 就咱俩
This is fun -- just the two of us.

198
00:07:11,980 --> 00:07:14,600
是啊 这些手杖真是登山神器啊
Yeah. And the walking sticks are a real game changer.

199
00:07:14,860 --> 00:07:16,720
等一下 我们到观景点了
Hold the phone. We've hit a vista.

200
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:21,780
看来你不是这里唯一的小山雀
Looks like you're not the only mountain chickadee around here.

201
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:22,820
你发现了一只吗
You spotted one?

202
00:07:22,820 --> 00:07:25,300
等轮到你时 注意它颈部的黑色羽毛
When it's your turn, note her black bib.

203
00:07:25,780 --> 00:07:26,220
好的
Okay.

204
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:30,560
-我的天啊 -它是不是好优雅
- Oh, my God. - Isn't she majestic?

205
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:31,780
菲尔 我们就是他们
Phil, we're them.

206
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:34,020
我们和老年人宣传册的封面一样一样
We're the cover of the old people's pamphlet.

207
00:07:35,811 --> 00:07:37,460
这是要"闹哪样"
Well, that's a fine "How do ya do."

208
00:07:37,460 --> 00:07:39,180
连册子上这人都不会说这么过时的话
Oh, even this guy wouldn't say that!

209
00:07:39,260 --> 00:07:39,920
你说得对
You're right!

210
00:07:40,140 --> 00:07:41,600
我们这是怎么了
What is wrong with us?

211
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:43,720
你看
Look!

212
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:46,400
那才是我们该做的
That's what we should be doing!

213
00:07:46,700 --> 00:07:49,400
我们只要想办法保持年轻和冒险精神就好
We just need to find ways to stay young and adventurous.

214
00:07:49,620 --> 00:07:50,380
我支持你 亲爱的
I'm with you, honey.

215
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:52,400
-我们走 -太好了
- Let's go! - Yes! Yes!

216
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:54,380
我不再需要你们了
I don't need you anymore!

217
00:07:58,892 --> 00:08:01,338
天啊 这东西习惯后还挺难戒的
Boy, you really get used to those things.

218
00:08:04,260 --> 00:08:06,200
我也不想对本这么狠心
It's not that I want to be mean to Ben.

219
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:08,480
只是他有时真的很烦人
He can just be so annoying sometimes.

220
00:08:08,500 --> 00:08:10,520
我知道人无完人
And I know nobody's perfect,

221
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:13,080
但难道那意味着我必须无视他所有缺点吗
but does that mean I have to ignore all of his flaws?

222
00:08:14,060 --> 00:08:15,700
还是说我才是问题所在
Or is the issue me?

223
00:08:16,062 --> 00:08:18,472
难道我理想中的人根本不存在吗
A-Am I just looking for something that doesn't exist?

224
00:08:19,180 --> 00:08:22,480
我真的能做到无条件去爱一个人吗
Am I even capable of loving someone unconditionally?

225
00:08:22,700 --> 00:08:24,760
我们明白 你有男朋友
We get it. You have a boyfriend.

226
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:28,260
那是那个男生的摩托艇
Hey, there's that guy's jet ski.

227
00:08:28,860 --> 00:08:30,080
那个女生的摩托艇
That girl's jet ski.

228
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:32,480
不管是男是女 对我有兴趣 老娘就要了
Whatever it was, it was into me, and I'm kissing it.

229
00:08:33,620 --> 00:08:35,020
帮我保管好别沾水 美人儿
Keep this dry for me, Pretty.

230
00:08:42,660 --> 00:08:44,220
我们走遍了整座岛
We walked around that whole island.

231
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:46,300
一个俊男靓女都没有
No hot boys, girls -- nothing.

232
00:08:46,420 --> 00:08:47,340
只有一大堆鸟
Just a bunch of birds.

233
00:08:47,340 --> 00:08:48,820
甚至都不是好看的鸟
And not even hot birds.

234
00:08:51,020 --> 00:08:52,360
我们的船呢
Hey, where's our boat?

235
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:55,480
不见了
It's gone.

236
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:56,860
他们的水上摩托也不见了
And so are their jet skis.

237
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:58,740
他们把我们引到这来仙人跳
They lured us out here and stole our stuff.

238
00:08:59,540 --> 00:09:01,900
白痴 你还以为那女生是真的喜欢你
You idiot. You thought that girl really liked you.

239
00:09:04,380 --> 00:09:06,640
"休是世上最好的岳父
"Hugh was the world's greatest father-in-law.

240
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:10,160
他总是在一旁支持我 随时为我伸出援手
He was always there for me, ready to lend a helping hand."

241
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,457
你在干什么 菲尔
What are you doing, Phil?

242
00:09:12,457 --> 00:09:13,571
我在等克莱尔
Oh, I'm just waiting out here

243
00:09:13,571 --> 00:09:15,540
等她换好衣服我们就去悬崖跳水
while Claire changes for our cliff dive.

244
00:09:15,540 --> 00:09:18,080
感觉你需要人帮忙涂这麻烦的防晒霜
Looks like you could use some help with that pesky sunscreen.

245
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:19,320
-这么好 -对啊
- Really? - Yeah.

246
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:20,280
谢谢
Thanks!

247
00:09:21,340 --> 00:09:22,360
来
There you go.

248
00:09:24,380 --> 00:09:25,420
好痒
It tickles!

249
00:09:25,660 --> 00:09:27,300
-菲尔 -我懂 我懂
- Listen, Phil -- I know, I know.

250
00:09:27,340 --> 00:09:29,000
-把这件事忘掉 -是必需得记得
- This never happened. - Oh, it happened.

251
00:09:29,100 --> 00:09:31,520
永远不要忘记你岳父这双强健的大手
Never forget how these strong father-in-law hands

252
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:32,260
给你带来的愉悦
gave you pleasure.

253
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:36,860
"我的爸爸休曾给予我箴言
"My dad, Hugh, once gave me the best advice --

254
00:09:37,660 --> 00:09:39,840
要怀抱勇气去选择自己的路
have the courage to choose your own path,

255
00:09:39,900 --> 00:09:41,980
而不是别人希望你走的路
not the path others expect of you.

256
00:09:42,300 --> 00:09:44,460
这些话改变了我的一生"
Those words changed my life forever."

257
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:47,680
发生什么事了 儿子
What's going on, son?

258
00:09:48,140 --> 00:09:50,740
我知道肯定发生了什么事 我真心在乎你
I know there's a story there, and I really care.

259
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:51,540
没事
It's nothing.

260
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,340
放下心防
Walls down, please.

261
00:09:53,756 --> 00:09:55,084
好吧 我告诉你
Ugh. Okay, fine.

262
00:09:55,612 --> 00:09:56,820
这事挺难堪的
Um, it's really embarrassing.

263
00:09:57,143 --> 00:09:59,212
我在渔具用品店碰到了一个员工
Uh, I ran into this guy who works at the bait shop.

264
00:09:59,212 --> 00:10:00,410
那是家同志酒吧吗
Is that a gay bar?

265
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:02,140
不是 是真的渔具用品店
No, an actual bait shop.

266
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:04,200
多年前我对他发动过攻势
And I came on to him years ago.

267
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,660
结果发现他是直男
It turns out he was straight.

268
00:10:05,703 --> 00:10:07,968
我受到的创伤至今还没愈合
And I'm -- I'm still traumatized by it.

269
00:10:08,140 --> 00:10:09,660
让我给你点建议
Let me give you some advice.

270
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:13,180
朝难堪跑去 而非逃离它
Run toward embarrassment, not away from it.

271
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:14,100
明白了吗
You got that?

272
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,620
等等 什么意思
Wait. What?

273
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:16,720
去跟他谈谈
Go talk to the guy.

274
00:10:17,060 --> 00:10:19,880
朝难堪跑去 而非逃离它
Run toward embarrassment, not away from it,

275
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:21,160
如此才能击倒它
and you take away its power.

276
00:10:21,300 --> 00:10:22,557
这个建议还真不坏
That's actually not the worst advice.

277
00:10:22,557 --> 00:10:23,680
简直棒极了
It's great advice.

278
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:24,920
你应该把它记下来
In fact, you should write it down.

279
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,380
感觉哪天可以再引用
It feels quotable.

280
00:10:26,500 --> 00:10:27,100
知道吗
You know what?

281
00:10:27,420 --> 00:10:28,720
我要重新站起来面对他
I am. I'm going back there.

282
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:29,660
你能做到的 米奇尔
You got this, Mitchell.

283
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:31,080
记住这是你爸爸又一次
Just think of it as one more time

284
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:33,280
帮助你解决了你这些基佬问题
when your dad helped you out with all this gay business.

285
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:34,460
好吧
Yeah, okay.

286
00:10:36,340 --> 00:10:40,278
歌洛莉亚 你见过这么纯净透蓝的湖水吗
Oh, Gloria, have you ever seen such pristine blue water?

287
00:10:40,278 --> 00:10:42,500
那个是浮尸袋吗
Is that a floating duffel bag?

288
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:43,660
不是 是个浮标
No, that's just a buoy.

289
00:10:44,252 --> 00:10:44,758
一个男孩吗[音似]
A boy?!

290
00:10:44,758 --> 00:10:46,683
不是 是浮标
No, a buoy. A --

291
00:10:47,373 --> 00:10:49,454
我的防晒衫卡在...
Oh, my caftan's stuck in the --

292
00:10:50,660 --> 00:10:51,840
太阳
The sun!

293
00:10:58,460 --> 00:10:59,740
快好了
Almost done.

294
00:10:59,820 --> 00:11:01,380
再吹几下就好了 好吗
Just a few more puffs, okay?

295
00:11:01,500 --> 00:11:03,240
不能看卡通《泡泡孔雀鱼》就好吗
Can't we just watch "Groovy Guppies"?

296
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:05,140
相信我 这个好玩多了
Trust me, this will be way more fun.

297
00:11:18,380 --> 00:11:20,800
别担心 他不会有事
Don't worry. He'll be fine.

298
00:11:25,500 --> 00:11:26,300
磨快点
Go faster!

299
00:11:26,420 --> 00:11:28,200
你不是在拉小提琴 你是要生火
It's not a violin. You're trying to start a fire.

300
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:29,578
放轻松啊 兄弟
Hey, chill, man!

301
00:11:29,578 --> 00:11:30,820
这样没用的
That's never gonna work.

302
00:11:30,820 --> 00:11:32,600
我们得找个更好的办法通知别人我们在这
We need a better way to let someone know we're out here.

303
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:33,880
谁带镜子了吗
Anyone have a mirror?

304
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:37,540
好主意 我们可以反射阳光提醒过往的飞机
Good idea. We can reflect the sun onto a passing plane.

305
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:39,480
不 我只是想照照镜子
No, I just have a feeling that my hair

306
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:40,980
看看我完美的秀发
looks really good right now.

307
00:11:41,851 --> 00:11:43,576
我的小指头扎到木刺了
I got a splinter in my pinkie!

308
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:45,980
看来硬汉的曼尼尔已死
I think we have a time of death on Manuel.

309
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,240
闭嘴 都怪你
Shut up! It's your fault

310
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:49,100
要我快速钻木取火
for making me rub those sticks together so fast.

311
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:51,080
怪我 要不是这两个蜥蜴脑袋
My fault? We wouldn't even be out here

312
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:52,260
管不住裤腰带
if it weren't for these two lizard brains

313
00:11:52,260 --> 00:11:53,520
我们根本就不会来这儿
not being able to keep it in their pants.

314
00:11:53,660 --> 00:11:55,680
你只是在嫉妒我们不会因为有人爱
You're just jealous because we don't hate ourselves

315
00:11:55,680 --> 00:11:57,000
而自怨自艾
for being attracted to other people.

316
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:59,080
拜托 我才不要听一个今早发短信
Please! I'm not accepting a psych evaluation

317
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,740
让我把他从厕所救出去的人
from somebody who texted me for help

318
00:12:00,740 --> 00:12:02,300
来给我做的什么心理评估
getting out of the bathroom this morning.

319
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:03,400
船上的锁不一样嘛
Boat locks are different!

320
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,080
其实他说得对
He's right, you know.

321
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:07,100
这是你第一次带男友出来旅行
This is your first time bringing a boy on vacation,

322
00:12:07,100 --> 00:12:09,180
他跟我们全家坐在一起的一瞬间
and the second he sat down with the whole family,

323
00:12:09,540 --> 00:12:11,360
恋情一下变得太有真实感
things started to get a little too real for you.

324
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:13,560
所以你就开始对本吹毛求疵
So you started to pick Ben apart

325
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:15,400
好为自己把他推开找借口
so you could justify pushing him away.

326
00:12:16,780 --> 00:12:17,820
我没有吧
I don't think I do that.

327
00:12:18,520 --> 00:12:19,300
我这么做了吗
Do I do that?

328
00:12:20,380 --> 00:12:21,600
我真的这么做了
I do do that.

329
00:12:21,740 --> 00:12:24,380
其实仔细想想 我跟你也差不多
When you think about it, I'm in a similar situation.

330
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:26,240
上大学的事越来越有真实感了
College is getting a little real,

331
00:12:26,300 --> 00:12:29,320
我有点担心又多一群新的人排挤我
and maybe I'm nervous about a whole new group of people

332
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:31,760
所以我把曼尼的一面藏了起来
rejecting me, so I hid Manny away.

333
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:33,560
说到底
After all...

334
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:35,960
没见过 就伤不到
can't hurt a man they'll never meet.

335
00:12:37,149 --> 00:12:39,053
-我想念曼尼尔了 -是啊
- Ugh. I miss Manuel. - Yeah.

336
00:12:41,116 --> 00:12:43,251
-你好 -又来抢劫我了吗
- Oh, hi. - Uh-oh. Here to rob me again?

337
00:12:43,378 --> 00:12:45,440
刚才很抱歉 我不是有意要吓你
Sorry about that. I-I didn't mean to scare you.

338
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,820
没有 你根本没吓着我
Oh, no. You didn't scare me at all.

339
00:12:47,140 --> 00:12:48,600
事实上我才是那个抢钱的
As a matter of fact, I'm the one robbing you.

340
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:50,802
在镇上这些虫子才卖五分钱
Back in town, these worms are 5 cents each.

341
00:12:51,259 --> 00:12:52,142
听着
Ah. So, um, listen.

342
00:12:52,142 --> 00:12:53,827
其实我们 我们以前就认识了
We -- We actually do know each other.

343
00:12:54,325 --> 00:12:56,517
我是米奇尔·普里契特 89年暑假 记得吗
Uh, Mitchell Pritchett. Summer of '89?

344
00:12:56,700 --> 00:12:58,020
我送了你我的任天堂游戏机
I let you have my Nintendo Game Boy?

345
00:12:58,020 --> 00:12:59,880
米奇·普里契 当然了
Mitchy Pritchy! Of course!

346
00:12:59,880 --> 00:13:01,539
当时可生那游戏机的气了
You were mad about that Game Boy

347
00:13:01,539 --> 00:13:02,669
因为你爸给你买的是游戏机
'cause your dad got you that

348
00:13:02,669 --> 00:13:04,480
而不是什么雪儿的专辑
instead of, like, some Cher album.

349
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:05,620
《如果时间倒转》专辑
"If I Could Turn Back Time."

350
00:13:05,760 --> 00:13:07,260
我来这里就是因为这些
Which brings me to why I'm here.

351
00:13:07,876 --> 00:13:09,440
我不确定你是否还记得
Um, I don't know if you remember this,

352
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:11,660
但我有一次想亲你 我...
but I tried to kiss you once, and I've --

353
00:13:11,660 --> 00:13:13,370
我只是经常... 我对此深感愧疚
I've just always -- I've felt really terrible about it.

354
00:13:13,370 --> 00:13:14,520
我只想说声抱歉
And I just wanted to say I'm sorry.

355
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:16,640
对 没事 我都忘得差不多了
Oh, yeah. No, I barely remember that.

356
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:18,960
我们过了个很愉快的暑假 别放心上了
We had a great summer. Don't think twice about it.

357
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:21,100
这真是... 让人松了口气
Oh! That is -- that is such a relief.

358
00:13:21,100 --> 00:13:23,334
还记得我们偷了我爸的卡车 然后开去赌场吗
Remember we stole my dad's truck and took it to the casino?

359
00:13:23,334 --> 00:13:24,820
-记得啊 -我想逗你开心
- Right. - I was trying to cheer you up

360
00:13:24,820 --> 00:13:26,779
因为那个恶霸老是把你推到湖里去
because that bully kept pushing you in the lake.

361
00:13:26,779 --> 00:13:28,634
那是克莱尔 对 不过我们现在挺好的
Claire. Yeah. No, we're cool now.

362
00:13:29,255 --> 00:13:30,540
听我说 很高兴见到你
Um, so, listen, good to see you.

363
00:13:30,540 --> 00:13:31,280
很高兴见到你
Great to see you.

364
00:13:32,100 --> 00:13:34,120
听我说 谢谢你理解我
Oh, and, hey, listen. Thank you so much for understanding.

365
00:13:34,220 --> 00:13:36,140
很多直男根本不可能这么友好
A lot of straight guys wouldn't have been so nice.

366
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,860
直男 我不是直男
Straight? I'm not straight.

367
00:13:38,540 --> 00:13:39,217
抱歉 你说什么
I'm sorry. What?

368
00:13:39,217 --> 00:13:41,369
我比三只塞在水桶里的龙虾还要"弯"曲
I'm gayer than three crawdaddies in a bucket.

369
00:13:41,380 --> 00:13:42,580
你们要买鱼饵吗
Were you guys looking for bait?

370
00:13:42,700 --> 00:13:44,120
我刚进了一些加州短虫
I just got in some California Short Worms

371
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:46,360
绝对不是把正常虫子切成两半的啊
that are definitely not regular worms cut in half.

372
00:13:51,340 --> 00:13:52,340
你准备好了吗
You ready to do this?

373
00:13:52,780 --> 00:13:53,680
那当然
So ready!

374
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,260
跳进这个悬崖水底就表示
Jumping off this cliff represents

375
00:13:55,260 --> 00:13:56,760
我们像冒险者一样跳进我们的未来
jumping into our future as adventurers.

376
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:58,680
好了 数到三
Okay. Count of three.

377
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:01,460
一 二 三
One, two, three!

378
00:14:02,391 --> 00:14:04,141
菲尔
Phiiiilllll!

379
00:14:09,500 --> 00:14:09,940
亲爱的
Honey...

380
00:14:09,940 --> 00:14:11,380
-怎么了 -我很抱歉
- What happened? - I'm so sorry.

381
00:14:11,740 --> 00:14:12,720
我最后一秒退缩了
I bailed at the last second.

382
00:14:12,860 --> 00:14:14,100
但我现在准备好了 我发誓
But I'm ready now. I promise.

383
00:14:14,900 --> 00:14:17,860
-准备好了 -一二三
- Ready? - One, two, three!

384
00:14:18,158 --> 00:14:19,547
我靠...
Come o--

385
00:14:22,780 --> 00:14:24,340
你在这儿呢
Oh. Hey. There you are.

386
00:14:25,176 --> 00:14:26,040
我觉得你好像
Um, I feel like you

387
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:27,560
数到二就抢跳了
jumped on "two." Oh!

388
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:31,720
亲爱的 跳 很好玩 真的超好玩
Honey, jumping -- it's fun. It's really fun.

389
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:33,260
但是重点是跟你一起跳
But the point was to do it with you.

390
00:14:33,272 --> 00:14:34,792
所以如果不行的话...
So if that's gonna be a problem --

391
00:14:34,792 --> 00:14:36,680
不 我...我真的想尝试一下
No, I-I definitely want to do it.

392
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:38,080
但问题是
It's just that I'm having

393
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:39,829
我控制不住我的腿
a hard time getting my legs to cooperate.

394
00:14:39,829 --> 00:14:41,984
好吧 你得推我
Okay. You're gonna have to push me.

395
00:14:42,100 --> 00:14:43,140
-你确定吗 -确定
- Are you sure? - Yes.

396
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:44,760
用力推我一下 我没事
Just one hard push, and I'm good.

397
00:14:45,520 --> 00:14:46,020
好的
Okay.

398
00:14:49,540 --> 00:14:50,040
来
Here...

399
00:14:51,500 --> 00:14:52,000
走
we...

400
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:52,200
你
go --

401
00:14:52,284 --> 00:14:54,647
我去...
Oh, come o--

402
00:15:00,482 --> 00:15:03,500
别再这么晃这玩意儿了
Stop rocking this thing so much.

403
00:15:03,500 --> 00:15:04,557
我要开始晕船了
I am getting seasick.

404
00:15:04,557 --> 00:15:07,567
你可真可怜 要是你...
Well, you poor thing. Maybe if you had --

405
00:15:07,634 --> 00:15:10,120
抽筋 抽筋 抽筋 抽筋了
Uh-oh! Cramp, cramp, cramp, cramp, cramp, cramp!

406
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:11,610
我小腿抽筋了 小腿抽筋了
Calf's cramping up! Calf's cramping up!

407
00:15:11,610 --> 00:15:13,209
歌洛莉亚 快帮我揉我小腿
Gloria, I need you to rub my calf!

408
00:15:13,209 --> 00:15:15,362
不 我不要碰这水
No! I'm not gonna touch that water!

409
00:15:15,362 --> 00:15:16,336
歌洛莉亚 我现在疼死了
Gloria, I'm in so much pain!

410
00:15:16,336 --> 00:15:18,100
你得稍微用力帮我压一下
You got to put a little pressure on it!

411
00:15:18,100 --> 00:15:19,260
用力压一下我的小腿
Put a little pressure on my calf!

412
00:15:19,340 --> 00:15:20,280
好了
Okay, fine!

413
00:15:22,640 --> 00:15:23,560
我够不着
I can't get it.

414
00:15:26,416 --> 00:15:28,036
我掉进湖里了
I'm in the lake!

415
00:15:28,066 --> 00:15:29,816
我掉进湖里了
I'm in the lake!

416
00:15:29,847 --> 00:15:31,587
不要啊
Ay, no! Ay! Ay!

417
00:15:32,855 --> 00:15:34,806
你知道吗 我小腿不抽了
Oh! What do you know? My cramp's gone.

418
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:38,460
我又来了 问个小问题
Hi, again. Quick question.

419
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:39,517
鱼饵恕不退换
No refunds on the bait.

420
00:15:39,517 --> 00:15:41,045
你买的时候肯定是活的
They were alive when you bought them.

421
00:15:41,491 --> 00:15:42,920
是米奇啊 抱歉
Oh. Hey, Mitchy. Sorry.

422
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:46,280
我就是好奇 在我们一起玩过后多久
Just curious -- um, how long after we hung out

423
00:15:46,280 --> 00:15:47,759
你意识到你是同性恋的
did you realize that you were gay?

424
00:15:47,759 --> 00:15:50,474
不... 其实是在那之前好几年
Oh, no, it was -- it was years before that.

425
00:15:50,599 --> 00:15:51,654
好吧 所以那时候
Oh. Okay. So -- So, back then,

426
00:15:51,654 --> 00:15:53,680
你说你... "不感兴趣"时
when you said that you -- you weren't "into this,"

427
00:15:53,680 --> 00:15:54,920
是指对我不感兴趣吗
you meant that you weren't into me.

428
00:15:55,040 --> 00:15:56,740
-这个嘛... -因为我肯定是当时方圆几里内
- Well... - Because I must have been the only gay kid

429
00:15:56,740 --> 00:15:58,520
-唯一同性恋小孩 对吧 -我不...
- around for miles, right? - Oh, I don't --

430
00:15:58,520 --> 00:16:00,060
是啦 基本上是这样没错
Yeah, I mean, technically, yeah.

431
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:01,060
让我理一下
Let me get this right.

432
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:03,540
你待在这么个破地儿 根本没别人可选
You're in the middle of nowhere, with no other options,

433
00:16:03,540 --> 00:16:06,460
在一个刮点风都"性奋"的年纪
at an age where a boy gets excited by the wind,

434
00:16:06,460 --> 00:16:08,640
然后你看着我 表示"还是算了吧"
and you looked at me, and you said, "Ooh, pass."

435
00:16:08,908 --> 00:16:09,980
我...
W-- I --

436
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:10,780
抱歉
I'm sorry.

437
00:16:11,460 --> 00:16:12,180
我很抱歉
I feel bad.

438
00:16:12,520 --> 00:16:14,040
虽然已经是30年前的事了
It was 30 years ago, though.

439
00:16:14,800 --> 00:16:16,480
你想要点...免费鱼饵吗
You want some... free bait?

440
00:16:16,880 --> 00:16:17,337
要买诱饵吗
Have a lure?

441
00:16:17,337 --> 00:16:19,404
貌似我的确没有"诱惑力"
Apparently, I don't have allure.

442
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:22,140
好了 歌洛莉亚 那里有家店
Okay, Gloria, there's a store.

443
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:24,360
过去 随便买个能盖住我的东西
Go in there. Get me something to cover me up with -- anything.

444
00:16:24,640 --> 00:16:26,460
但如果有颜色可选 不要黄色和绿色
But if there is a color choice, avoid yellow and green.

445
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:27,154
会显得我气色不好
It washes me out.

446
00:16:27,154 --> 00:16:29,380
是啊 小卡 我也很想帮你
Oh, yeah, Cam, I would love to help you --

447
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:31,920
就像你帮我掉进那个肮脏的湖里一样
the same way you helped me fall into that filthy lake!

448
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:35,520
孩子们 小心裸男啊
Hey, kids! Watch out for the naked man!

449
00:16:35,719 --> 00:16:36,718
-什么 歌洛莉亚 -祝你好运
- What? Gloria? - Good luck.

450
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:37,140
歌洛莉亚
Gloria!

451
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:41,800
克莱尔
Claire!

452
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:43,800
克莱尔
Claire!!

453
00:16:44,920 --> 00:16:45,480
快看
Look!

454
00:16:46,189 --> 00:16:47,799
我搞了个喷射背包
I got a jetpack!

455
00:16:51,820 --> 00:16:54,380
我不想成为拖累你的人
I don't want to be the one to hold you back!

456
00:16:55,330 --> 00:16:59,182
我没想到会这么难控...
I didn't think it'd be this hard to contr--

457
00:16:59,764 --> 00:17:00,713
菲尔
Phil!

458
00:17:00,740 --> 00:17:02,200
天啊
Oh, my God!

459
00:17:02,380 --> 00:17:03,960
你看 我们才不无聊呢
Look! We're not boring!

460
00:17:04,420 --> 00:17:05,920
我们还很有冒险精神呢
We're still adventurous!

461
00:17:06,180 --> 00:17:07,440
我看出来了
I can see that!

462
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:09,120
我真是太为你骄傲了
I'm so proud of you!

463
00:17:09,380 --> 00:17:10,740
我好爱你
I love you so much.

464
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:14,480
克莱尔
Claire?

465
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:16,081
没事的 宝贝 别怕
Oh, no, honey. Don't worry.

466
00:17:16,081 --> 00:17:17,800
只是日食而已
I-It's just the eclipse.

467
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:20,520
我分不清那边是天那边是地了
I can't tell if I'm headed up or down!

468
00:17:26,940 --> 00:17:28,740
你好 黑暗 我的老朋友[歌词]
Hello darkness, my old friend

469
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:33,380
大家人呢
Where is everybody?

470
00:17:34,760 --> 00:17:35,880
算了 不来也无所谓
Ah, who needs them?

471
00:17:36,495 --> 00:17:38,535
这是个挺特别的时刻对吧 乔
This is a pretty special moment, huh, Joey?

472
00:17:40,554 --> 00:17:42,361
估计你也不会记得这段时光
Eh, you're never gonna remember any of this.

473
00:17:45,320 --> 00:17:46,120
如果可以的话
If you don't mind,

474
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,709
我是想出去看日食的
I -- I do want to go outside and see the eclipse.

475
00:17:47,709 --> 00:17:49,880
我还没完呢 你给我听好了
Oh, I'm not done. Just -- Just so you know,

476
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:52,760
很多人觉得我特有魅力好吗
plenty of people find me very attractive, okay,

477
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:55,475
包括我超赞 而且完全不懒散的老公
including my amazing husband, who is no slouch himself.

478
00:17:55,475 --> 00:17:58,680
请问您有卖穆穆袍吗
Hi. Do you sell muumuus?

479
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:00,680
我现在要去找我老公了
And I am gonna go find him right now.

480
00:18:05,540 --> 00:18:07,540
-那是什么 -天啊 是本
- Hey, what's that? - Oh, my God! It's Ben!

481
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:08,780
他来救我了
He came to rescue me!

482
00:18:09,180 --> 00:18:10,740
我独自飘在水上
I was out there all alone.

483
00:18:10,740 --> 00:18:12,540
突然就黑了
And then it got really dark.

484
00:18:12,848 --> 00:18:14,554
而且我快渴死了
And I'm so thirsty.

485
00:18:14,620 --> 00:18:15,680
靠 我沾到了泥
Ew! I got mud on me.

486
00:18:17,580 --> 00:18:19,660
对不起 我不该对你撒气
I'm so sorry I lashed out at you.

487
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:22,360
我好像每次跟人太走心就会这样
I think I do it when I start getting close to someone.

488
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:24,860
但我想跟你走心
But I want to be close to you.

489
00:18:25,020 --> 00:18:26,160
我也想啊
I want that, too.

490
00:18:26,940 --> 00:18:28,560
来吧 我们可以拿这个当桨
Come on. We can use this as an oar.

491
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:33,200
一船载不下所有人啊
Oh, there's not enough room for all of us.

492
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:35,880
我们俩可以在这里等你们...
Well, the two of us can stay while you --

493
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:37,100
我再回来救你
I'll come back for you!

494
00:18:39,060 --> 00:18:39,680
好吧
All right.

495
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:47,580
哎哟哟 哪来的稀客啊
Well, well, well. Look who finally showed up.

496
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:50,680
或许我们99年后可以再试着看一次
Maybe we can try this again in another 99 years.

497
00:18:50,860 --> 00:18:52,440
其实 下一次日全食只要再过
Actually, there'll be another total eclipse again

498
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:54,560
-7年就能看到 -没人想听你的傻逼科学
- in the next seven years. - No one wants your stupid science, Alex!

499
00:18:55,540 --> 00:18:56,620
我就要求了一件事
I asked for one thing --

500
00:18:56,980 --> 00:18:59,780
以我为中心 一起创造这一段回忆
to share a memory with all of us with me at the center of it!

501
00:18:59,780 --> 00:19:00,480
还有
And by the way,

502
00:19:01,180 --> 00:19:05,140
因为是日食大热期 船费还是超贵费率
I had to pay surge boat rates because of eclipse fever!

503
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:06,520
能进他的抱怨排行榜了
This is an all-time rant.

504
00:19:06,620 --> 00:19:08,740
对啊 前三名吧 84年圣诞那次
Oh, yeah, top three. It goes Christmas '84,

505
00:19:08,980 --> 00:19:10,120
还有他预定了猪肉
that wedding where he ordered the pork

506
00:19:10,220 --> 00:19:11,360
结果送来了鸡肉的婚礼那次
but they gave him the chicken instead,

507
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,380
然后就是日食周末
and eclipse weekend.

508
00:19:12,440 --> 00:19:13,640
我唯一去那次婚礼的原因
The only reason I went to that wedding

509
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:14,820
就是他妈的为了吃那个猪肉
was because of the damn pork!

510
00:19:14,820 --> 00:19:17,340
你们以后就只会记得我这件事了吗
Is this gonna be the only thing you guys remember about me?!

511
00:19:17,520 --> 00:19:19,220
你搞这出是因为休·邓肯去世后
Does this have something to do with Hugh Duncan dying

512
00:19:19,220 --> 00:19:20,539
他脸书上的那些夸赞之词吗
and all those Facebook tributes?

513
00:19:20,539 --> 00:19:23,620
-你放屁 -等等 你是想要故意制造美好回忆
- No!! - Wait, w-were you trying to manufacture nice moments

514
00:19:23,620 --> 00:19:25,600
所以你去世以后我们会说你好话吗
so that we'll say good things about you when you're gone?

515
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:27,320
等等 所以你才送我你的天文望远镜吗
Wait. Is that why you gave me your telescope?

516
00:19:27,494 --> 00:19:30,494
擦防晒霜呢 那都是虚情假意吗
And the -- the sunscreen? That wasn't real?

517
00:19:30,494 --> 00:19:31,780
我懒得跟你们说了
I don't want to talk about this!

518
00:19:31,780 --> 00:19:32,840
杰 你上哪去呢
Jay, where are you going?!

519
00:19:33,520 --> 00:19:36,160
我的老天爷啊 老爸 别走啊
Oh, for God's sakes! Dad! Come back!

520
00:19:38,060 --> 00:19:38,860
外公 别走啊
Grandpa, stop!

521
00:19:39,040 --> 00:19:40,760
我们有大把属于你的美好回忆啊
We have tons of great memories of you!

522
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:42,100
你就是说了哄我而已
You're just saying that!

523
00:19:42,300 --> 00:19:43,440
谁快举个例子
Someone think of an example!

524
00:19:45,660 --> 00:19:47,720
你以前出差回来
You used to bring me back magnets

525
00:19:47,720 --> 00:19:49,960
都会给我带各式各样的纪念磁铁
every time you went away on a business trip!

526
00:19:50,020 --> 00:19:51,180
超级有心
It was so thoughtful!

527
00:19:51,320 --> 00:19:53,920
当你发现我喜欢杏仁奶的时候
Yeah, when you found out I was into almond milk,

528
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:57,100
你去量贩超市给我买了一大桶保久杏仁奶
you went to Costco and got me that giant thing of almond milk!

529
00:19:57,180 --> 00:19:59,520
你喜欢喝 而且不会变质
Well, you like it, and it doesn't go bad.

530
00:19:59,740 --> 00:20:02,080
我妈妈去世时 你给我发了一周短信
When my mom died, you texted me every day

531
00:20:02,080 --> 00:20:03,780
天天关心我好不好
for a week to check on me!

532
00:20:04,079 --> 00:20:06,080
你吃小熊糖总是给我留红色小熊
